<p>Hogaye Shabbir (asws) Tanha Margaya Beta Jawaa'n.</p>

<p>1. Zalzala Aaya Zamee'n Ko Kaanp Utha Aasma'n *2.</p>

<p>Jalti Reti Par Jon'hi.. Akbar Ne Ragdi Ediyaa'n.</p>

<p>2. Jisko Athara(18) Baras Paala Tha Armaano'n Ke Saath..*2.</p>

<p>Haaye Us Kadiyal Jawaa'n Ke.... Seene Mein Tooti Sinaa.</p>

<p>3. Tere Baba Ne Tadapte Dekha Hain Akbar (asws) Tujhe..*2.</p>

<p>Kaise Bhoolega Dam E .... Aaqir Wo Teri Hichkiyaa'n.</p>

<p>4. Tere Gham Mein Badh Gayi Yun Tishnagi Shabbir (asws) Ki..*2.</p>

<p>Ek Dhuaa'n Sa Chaa Gaya.... Arzo Samaa Ke Darmiyaa'n.</p>

<p>5. Dekha Hai Jalti Zamee'n Par Laasha Tera Bekafan..*2.</p>

<p>Ab Na Saaye Mein Kabhi..... Baithegi Akber (asws) Teri Maa'n.</p>

<p>6. Jiska Baba Saaqi E Kousar (asws) Ka Ahsan Laal Hain..*2.</p>

<p>Pyaas Ki Shiddat Mein Nikli..... Us Jawaa'n Bete Ki Jaa'n.</p>

<p>Margaya Beta Jawaa'n.</p>

<p><center><h1>Kalaam: Janab Hassan Abbas Ahsan Sahab.</h1></center></p>